+ - New discoveries: 8
+ - Contradictions fixed: 1
+ - Recurring themes: 3
+ 💾 MEMORY.md Updates:
+ - [+] 8 sections added
+ - [~] 1 outdated entry corrected
+ - [-] 0 invalid entries pruned
+ 📝 Archives:
+ - Marked 12 daily files older than 30 days
+ 💡 Suggestions:
+ - Consider archiving files before 2026-03-01
